 "summary": "Panel-mount heating and cooling PID temperature controller with Modbus RTU. Coils start/stop control and auto-tuning; input registers report PV, active SV, decimal point, heating/cooling MV, heater current and indicator bits; holding registers carry setpoints, multi-SV, alarm limits, PID parameters, input and output setup and communication settings.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU"
 ],
